# Who Wants to be a PoliMillionaire? — NLP Group Assignment 2025/26

An automated agent that plays the online quiz game *"Who Wants to be a PoliMillionaire?"*
using locally-run, open-weights language models, optional retrieval augmentation (RAG),
a speech interface, and LoRA fine-tuning.

## Contents

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `PoliMillionaire.ipynb` | Main notebook — the full combined pipeline (both models, RAG, speech, fine-tuning) |
| `PoliMillionaire.html`  | Rendered HTML export of the notebook (required hand-in format) |
| `game_log.json`         | Persistent answer-memory log used by the memory / elimination layer |
